        "original_id": "367831d6-1313-5482-9f5a-0dcc5e0888c6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Audrey Mossom\n- Events: Blackpool Illuminations\n- Places: Preston, Hastings, Blackpool, Lancashire, Fylde Coast\n\nFacts:\n- Blackpool Illuminations is an annual lights festival in Blackpool on the Fylde Coast in Lancashire, and it was founded in 1879 and first switched on on 19 September 1879.\n- Audrey Mossom was born as Elsie Audrey Mossom on 3 September 1920 in Preston and died on 1 September 2009 in Hastings.\n- Audrey Mossom was an English teen celebrity and later a professional dancer.\n- In 1935, Audrey Mossom turned on the Blackpool Illuminations.\n- Fifty years later, Audrey Mossom again turned on the Blackpool Illuminations.",
